{
  "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\" data-lang=\"zh\">\n  <head><meta charset=\"utf-8\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" /><title>Comet Native RC1 与 beta16 对比报告</title><style>\n      :root {\n        color-scheme: light;\n        --paper: #ffffff;\n        --canvas: #f3f1ec;\n        --ink: #191817;\n        --muted: #69645d;\n        --line: #cbc6bc;\n        --grid: #e8e4dc;\n        --native: #176b87;\n        --native-soft: #dcebf0;\n        --classic: #595b60;\n        --classic-soft: #e7e7e5;\n        --pass: #28745c;\n        --warn: #a5642b;\n        --fail: #a33a32;\n        --paper-font: \"Times New Roman\", SimSun, \"Songti SC\",\n          \"Noto Serif CJK SC\", \"Source Han Serif SC\", serif;\n      }\n\n      * {\n        box-sizing: border-box;\n      }\n\n      html {\n        background: var(--canvas);\n      }\n\n      body {\n        margin: 0;\n        background: var(--canvas);\n        color: var(--ink);\n        font: 15px/1.55 var(--paper-font);\n      }\n\n      main {\n        width: min(1040px, calc(100vw - 40px));\n        margin: 20px auto 52px;\n        padding: 52px 62px 64px;\n        background: var(--paper);\n        border: 1px solid #ddd8cf;\n        border-top: 2px solid var(--ink);\n      }\n\n      header.report-header {\n        max-width: 860px;\n        margin: 0 auto 34px;\n        text-align: center;\n      }\n\n      .kicker {\n        margin: 0 0 12px;\n        color: var(--muted);\n        font-size: 11px;\n        font-weight: 700;\n        letter-spacing: 0.14em;\n        text-transform: uppercase;\n      }\n\n      h1 {\n        margin: 0;\n        font-size: clamp(30px, 4.8vw, 48px);\n        line-height: 1.12;\n        letter-spacing: -0.025em;\n        text-wrap: balance;\n      }\n\n      .dek {\n        max-width: 760px;\n        margin: 20px auto 0;\n        color: var(--muted);\n        font-size: 16px;\n        text-wrap: pretty;\n      }\n\n      .meta {\n        display: flex;\n        flex-wrap: wrap;\n        justify-content: center;\n        gap: 8px 18px;\n        margin-top: 20px;\n        color: var(--muted);\n        font: 12px/1.4 var(--paper-font);\n      }\n\n      .language-toggle {\n        position: fixed;\n        top: 18px;\n        right: 18px;\n        z-index: 20;\n        display: inline-flex;\n        padding: 3px;\n        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.96);\n        border: 1px solid var(--line);\n        border-radius: 999px;\n        box-shadow: 0 8px 28px rgba(25, 24, 23, 0.12);\n        backdrop-filter: blur(8px);\n      }\n\n      .language-toggle a {\n        padding: 6px 12px;\n        border-radius: 999px;\n        color: var(--muted);\n        font: 700 12px/1.2 var(--paper-font);\n        text-decoration: none;\n      }\n\n      .language-toggle a.is-active {\n        background: var(--ink);\n        color: #fffdf8;\n      }\n\n      section {\n        margin-top: 36px;\n      }\n\n      h2 {\n        margin: 0 0 18px;\n        padding-bottom: 7px;\n        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink);\n        font-size: 18px;\n        line-height: 1.25;\n      }\n\n      h3 {\n        margin: 0 0 5px;\n        font-size: 15px;\n      }\n\n      p {\n        margin: 0 0 14px;\n      }\n\n      code {\n        padding: 0.08rem 0.24rem;\n        background: #f2f0eb;\n        font: 0.92em/1.4 var(--paper-font);\n      }\n\n      .metric-grid {\n        display: grid;\n        grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));\n        border-top: 1.5px solid var(--ink);\n        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink);\n      }\n\n      .metric {\n        min-width: 0;\n        padding: 18px 16px 16px;\n        border-right: 1px solid var(--grid);\n      }\n\n      .metric:last-child {\n        border-right: 0;\n      }\n\n      .metric-label {\n        min-height: 36px;\n        color: var(--muted);\n        font-size: 12px;\n        line-height: 1.35;\n      }\n\n      .metric-value {\n        display: block;\n        margin-top: 7px;\n        color: var(--native);\n        font-size: clamp(25px, 3vw, 34px);\n        font-weight: 700;\n        line-height: 1;\n        font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n      }\n\n      .metric-context {\n        display: block;\n        margin-top: 7px;\n        color: var(--muted);\n        font-size: 11px;\n      }\n\n      .figure {\n        margin-top: 22px;\n        padding-top: 14px;\n        border-top: 1.25px solid var(--ink);\n      }\n\n      .figure-head {\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: baseline;\n        justify-content: space-between;\n        gap: 16px;\n        margin-bottom: 16px;\n      }\n\n      .figure-title {\n        margin: 0;\n        font-size: 15px;\n      }\n\n      .figure-note {\n        color: var(--muted);\n        font-size: 12px;\n        text-align: right;\n      }\n\n      .legend {\n        display: flex;\n        flex-wrap: wrap;\n        gap: 8px 18px;\n        margin: 0 0 18px;\n        color: var(--muted);\n        font-size: 12px;\n      }\n\n      .legend span::before {\n        display: inline-block;\n        width: 18px;\n        height: 3px;\n        margin: 0 7px 3px 0;\n        background: var(--legend-color);\n        content: \"\";\n      }\n\n      .chart {\n        display: grid;\n        gap: 19px;\n      }\n\n      .chart-row {\n        display: grid;\n        grid-template-columns: 96px minmax(0, 1fr) 58px;\n        gap: 12px;\n        align-items: center;\n      }\n\n      .chart-label {\n        font-size: 13px;\n        font-weight: 700;\n      }\n\n      .bar-pair {\n        display: grid;\n        gap: 5px;\n      }\n\n      .track {\n        height: 10px;\n        background: repeating-linear-gradient(\n          to right,\n          transparent 0,\n          transparent calc(25% - 1px),\n          var(--grid) calc(25% - 1px),\n          var(--grid) 25%\n        );\n        border-left: 1px solid var(--line);\n      }\n\n      .bar {\n        width: var(--value);\n        height: 100%;\n        min-width: 2px;\n        background: var(--color);\n      }\n\n      .chart-value {\n        font: 700 12px/1.2 var(--paper-font);\n        text-align: right;\n      }\n\n      .caption {\n        margin: 14px 0 0;\n        color: var(--muted);\n        font-size: 12px;\n        text-wrap: pretty;\n      }\n\n      .table-scroll {\n        overflow-x: auto;\n        border-top: 1.5px solid var(--ink);\n        border-bottom: 1.5px solid var(--ink);\n      }\n\n      table {\n        width: 100%;\n        border-collapse: collapse;\n        font-size: 12.5px;\n      }\n\n      th,\n      td {\n        padding: 8px 10px;\n        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--grid);\n        text-align: left;\n        vertical-align: middle;\n      }\n\n      th {\n        border-bottom: 1.25px solid var(--ink);\n        font-weight: 700;\n        white-space: nowrap;\n      }\n\n      td.number,\n      th.number {\n        text-align: center;\n        font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n      }\n\n      tbody tr:last-child td {\n        border-bottom: 0;\n      }\n\n      .score {\n        display: inline-flex;\n        min-width: 46px;\n        justify-content: center;\n        padding: 3px 8px;\n        color: white;\n        background: var(--pass);\n        font: 700 11px/1.4 var(--paper-font);\n      }\n\n      .score.partial {\n        background: var(--warn);\n      }\n\n      .score.low {\n        background: var(--fail);\n      }\n\n      .method-grid {\n        display: grid;\n        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));\n        gap: 0;\n        border-top: 1.5px solid var(--ink);\n        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink);\n      }\n\n      .method-item {\n        padding: 15px 18px;\n        border-right: 1px solid var(--grid);\n        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--grid);\n      }\n\n      .method-item:nth-child(2n) {\n        border-right: 0;\n      }\n\n      .method-item:nth-last-child(-n + 2) {\n        border-bottom: 0;\n      }\n\n      .method-item p {\n        margin: 0;\n        color: var(--muted);\n        font-size: 12.5px;\n      }\n\n      .callout {\n        margin-top: 24px;\n        padding: 18px 20px;\n        background: #f4f2ed;\n        border-top: 1px solid var(--ink);\n        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);\n      }\n\n      .callout strong {\n        display: block;\n        margin-bottom: 5px;\n      }\n\n      .callout p {\n        margin: 0;\n        color: #44413d;\n      }\n\n      @media (max-width: 760px) {\n        main {\n          width: 100%;\n          margin: 0;\n          padding: 30px 20px 42px;\n          border-right: 0;\n          border-left: 0;\n        }\n\n        .metric-grid {\n          grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));\n        }\n\n        .metric:nth-child(2) {\n          border-right: 0;\n        }\n\n        .metric:nth-child(-n + 2) {\n          border-bottom: 1px solid var(--grid);\n        }\n\n        .method-grid {\n          grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n        }\n\n        .method-item,\n        .method-item:nth-child(2n),\n        .method-item:nth-last-child(-n + 2) {\n          border-right: 0;\n          border-bottom: 1px solid var(--grid);\n        }\n\n        .method-item:last-child {\n          border-bottom: 0;\n        }\n\n        .figure-head {\n          display: block;\n        }\n\n        .figure-note {\n          margin-top: 5px;\n          text-align: left;\n        }\n\n        .chart-row {\n          grid-template-columns: 76px minmax(0, 1fr) 50px;\n          gap: 8px;\n        }\n      }\n    </style></head>\n  <body><nav class=\"language-toggle\" aria-label=\"报告语言\"><a class=\"is-active\" href=\"/assets/eval-reports/comet-native-vs-rc1-beta16-20260828/native-benchmark-report.html\" target=\"_self\" data-locale=\"zh\">中文</a><a href=\"/assets/eval-reports/comet-native-vs-rc1-beta16-20260828/native-benchmark-report-en.html\" target=\"_self\" lang=\"en\" data-locale=\"en\">English</a></nav><main class=\"localized\" data-locale=\"zh\"><header class=\"report-header\"><p class=\"kicker\">Comet Eval · Native 版本对比</p><h1>Native RC1 与 beta16 对比报告</h1><p class=\"dek\">相同的 16 个业务任务、每个任务 3 次运行。业务验证器保持一致，workflow 验证器按各版本 Native 契约设置。</p><div class=\"meta\"><span>RC1 · 2026-08-28</span><span>beta16 · 2026-08-27—28</span><span>合计 96 次运行</span></div></header>\n      <section aria-labelledby=\"headline\"><h2 id=\"headline\">核心数据</h2><div class=\"metric-grid\"><article class=\"metric\"><div class=\"metric-label\">RC1 strict pass@1</div><span class=\"metric-value\">100.00%</span><span class=\"metric-context\">beta16：95.83%，+4.17 pp</span></article><article class=\"metric\"><div class=\"metric-label\">两版本 pass@3</div><span class=\"metric-value\">100%</span><span class=\"metric-context\">16/16 个任务至少成功一次</span></article><article class=\"metric\"><div class=\"metric-label\">RC1 pass^3</div><span class=\"metric-value\">100.00%</span><span class=\"metric-context\">beta16：87.50%，+12.50 pp</span></article><article class=\"metric\"><div class=\"metric-label\">平均累计模型耗时</div><span class=\"metric-value\">−22.3%</span><span class=\"metric-context\">391.3s vs 503.6s</span></article></div></section>\n      <section aria-labelledby=\"reliability\"><h2 id=\"reliability\">pass@k 实验结果</h2><article class=\"figure\"><div class=\"figure-head\"><h3 class=\"figure-title\">图 1. pass@1、pass@3 与 pass^3</h3><span class=\"figure-note\">百分比，越高越好</span></div><div class=\"legend\"><span style=\"--legend-color: var(--native)\">RC1</span><span style=\"--legend-color: var(--classic)\">beta16</span></div><div class=\"chart\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"RC1 与 beta16 可靠性指标对比\"><div class=\"chart-row\">\n              <div class=\"chart-label\">pass@1</div>\n              <div class=\"bar-pair\">\n                <div class=\"track\"><div class=\"bar\" style=\"--value: 100.00%; --color: var(--native)\"></div></div>\n                <div class=\"track\"><div class=\"bar\" style=\"--value: 95.83%; --color: var(--classic)\"></div></div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"chart-value\">100.0<br />95.8</div>\n            </div><div class=\"chart-row\">\n              <div class=\"chart-label\">pass@3</div>\n              <div class=\"bar-pair\">\n                <div class=\"track\"><div class=\"bar\" style=\"--value: 100.00%; --color: var(--native)\"></div></div>\n                <div class=\"track\"><div class=\"bar\" style=\"--value: 100.00%; --color: var(--classic)\"></div></div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"chart-value\">100<br />100</div>\n            </div><div class=\"chart-row\">\n              <div class=\"chart-label\">pass^3</div>\n              <div class=\"bar-pair\">\n                <div class=\"track\"><div class=\"bar\" style=\"--value: 100.00%; --color: var(--native)\"></div></div>\n                <div class=\"track\"><div class=\"bar\" style=\"--value: 87.50%; --color: var(--classic)\"></div></div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"chart-value\">100.0<br />87.5</div>\n            </div></div><p class=\"caption\"><code>pass@3</code> 只要求三次中至少一次成功；<code>pass^3</code> 要求三次全部成功。两者并列，才能同时看到能力覆盖与重复运行稳定性。</p></article></section>\n      <section aria-labelledby=\"efficiency\"><h2 id=\"efficiency\">完成任务的执行效率</h2><p>只统计两边都 strict pass 的 46 组相同任务重复，避免把提前失败误当成低消耗。</p><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>指标</th><th class=\"number\">RC1</th><th class=\"number\">beta16</th><th class=\"number\">RC1 差异</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>模型启动/恢复次数</td><td class=\"number\">1.15</td><td class=\"number\">1.89</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">−39.1%</span></td></tr><tr><td>Agent 轮次</td><td class=\"number\">83.39</td><td class=\"number\">77.54</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score partial\">+7.5%</span></td></tr><tr><td>工具调用</td><td class=\"number\">97.35</td><td class=\"number\">74.65</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score partial\">+30.4%</span></td></tr><tr><td>累计模型耗时</td><td class=\"number\">396.3s</td><td class=\"number\">501.6s</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">−21.0%</span></td></tr><tr><td>非缓存输入 Token</td><td class=\"number\">75,102</td><td class=\"number\">73,632</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score partial\">+2.0%</span></td></tr><tr><td>输出 Token</td><td class=\"number\">35,445</td><td class=\"number\">46,604</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">−23.9%</span></td></tr><tr><td>总 Token（包含缓存读取）</td><td class=\"number\">4,474,779</td><td class=\"number\">3,730,902</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score partial\">+19.9%</span></td></tr><tr><td>模型成本</td><td class=\"number\">$4.003</td><td class=\"number\">$3.348</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score partial\">+19.6%</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"caption\">两边 48/48 条轨迹都保留峰值上下文遥测；峰值上下文平均为 RC1 102,470 Token、beta16 104,208 Token。RC1 耗时更短，但配对成功视图中的轮次、工具调用、总 Token 和平均成本更高。</p></section>\n      <section aria-labelledby=\"latency\"><h2 id=\"latency\">修正后的模型耗时</h2><article class=\"figure\"><div class=\"figure-head\"><h3 class=\"figure-title\">图 2. 每次样本的累计原始 result duration</h3><span class=\"figure-note\">秒，越低越好</span></div><div class=\"legend\"><span style=\"--legend-color: var(--native)\">RC1</span><span style=\"--legend-color: var(--classic)\">beta16</span></div><div class=\"chart\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"RC1 与 beta16 修正耗时对比\"><div class=\"chart-row\">\n              <div class=\"chart-label\">平均值</div>\n              <div class=\"bar-pair\">\n                <div class=\"track\"><div class=\"bar\" style=\"--value: 77.70%; --color: var(--native)\"></div></div>\n                <div class=\"track\"><div class=\"bar\" style=\"--value: 100.00%; --color: var(--classic)\"></div></div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"chart-value\">391.3<br />503.6</div>\n            </div><div class=\"chart-row\">\n              <div class=\"chart-label\">中位数</div>\n              <div class=\"bar-pair\">\n                <div class=\"track\"><div class=\"bar\" style=\"--value: 77.45%; --color: var(--native)\"></div></div>\n                <div class=\"track\"><div class=\"bar\" style=\"--value: 100.00%; --color: var(--classic)\"></div></div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"chart-value\">369.1<br />476.5</div>\n            </div></div><p class=\"caption\">修正口径会累加一次样本所有顶层 <code>result.duration_ms</code>，不包含 Docker 准备和业务验证器运行时间。RC1 与 beta16 都有 48 个可观测耗时样本。</p></article></section>\n      <section aria-labelledby=\"matrix\"><h2 id=\"matrix\">任务级稳定性矩阵</h2><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>任务</th><th class=\"number\">RC1</th><th class=\"number\">beta16</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>agent-memory-routing</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td></tr><tr><td>api-cache-ttl</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td></tr><tr><td>cross-file-refactor</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score partial\">2/3</span></td></tr><tr><td>dependency-confusion</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td></tr><tr><td>fix-median</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td></tr><tr><td>framework-selection</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td></tr><tr><td>full-workflow</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td></tr><tr><td>graph-execution-review</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td></tr><tr><td>human-approval-flow</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td></tr><tr><td>layered-streaming-fix</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td></tr><tr><td>noise-distractor</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score partial\">2/3</span></td></tr><tr><td>observability-env-template</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td></tr><tr><td>perf-dedupe</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td></tr><tr><td>persistence-threading</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td></tr><tr><td>refactor-counter</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td></tr><tr><td>robust-config</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"caption\">RC1 有 16/16 个任务三次 strict pass；beta16 为 14/16。两边均覆盖全部 16 个任务的至少一次成功。</p></section>\n      <section aria-labelledby=\"failures\"><h2 id=\"failures\">失败归因</h2><div class=\"method-grid\"><article class=\"method-item\"><h3>RC1：parser 误报已校正</h3><p>原始快照中的 Skill <code>*</code> 来自 <code>find</code> 命令的 shell glob；修复后的 parser 只识别显式的 <code>comet-native</code> 调用。</p></article><article class=\"method-item\"><h3>beta16：1 次纯 workflow 失败</h3><p><code>cross-file-refactor</code> r3 缺少预期产物、终态状态和完整 trajectory，但业务验证通过。</p></article><article class=\"method-item\"><h3>beta16：1 次业务与 workflow 同时失败</h3><p><code>noise-distractor</code> r2 的 invoice 税率计算失败，同时缺少产物/状态/trajectory 证据。</p></article><article class=\"method-item\"><h3>Judge 不替代硬检查</h3><p>本报告采用确定性验证器、最终通过状态和原始 result 耗时，不用定性 Judge 文本替代它们。</p></article></div></section>\n      <section aria-labelledby=\"boundary\"><h2 id=\"boundary\">比较边界</h2><div class=\"method-grid\"><article class=\"method-item\"><h3>对齐的部分</h3><p>相同 16 个业务任务、验证器、模型选择、交互模式和 3 次重复。</p></article><article class=\"method-item\"><h3>版本特有的部分</h3><p>RC1 和 beta16 分别检查自己的 Native 产物、状态、loop 与 trajectory 契约。</p></article><article class=\"method-item\"><h3>分析集</h3><p>每个版本 48 个唯一报告，全部 included、high confidence；4 个 exit-125 恢复壳作为 harness 噪声排除。</p></article><article class=\"method-item\"><h3>时间窗口限制</h3><p>beta16 是复用的历史运行，因此耗时只能作为方向性证据，不是受控因果估计。</p></article></div><div class=\"callout\"><strong>结论</strong><p>在这组对齐样本中，RC1 保留了完整的任务级 pass@3 覆盖，提高了 strict 稳定性并缩短了原始模型耗时。但配对效率视图同时显示轮次、工具调用、总 Token 和成本上升，因此它是一个 trade-off，而不是全面的效率胜利。</p></div></section></main>\n    <main class=\"localized\" data-locale=\"en\" hidden><header class=\"report-header\">\n        <p class=\"kicker\">Comet Eval · Native Release Comparison</p>\n        <h1>Native RC1 vs. beta16 comparison report</h1>\n        <p class=\"dek\">The same 16 business tasks, three runs per task. Business validators are shared; workflow validators follow each release's Native contract.</p>\n        <div class=\"meta\"><span>RC1 · 2026-08-28</span><span>beta16 · 2026-08-27—28</span><span>96 runs total</span></div>\n      </header>\n      <section aria-labelledby=\"headline\"><h2 id=\"headline\">Headline metrics</h2><div class=\"metric-grid\">\n        <article class=\"metric\"><div class=\"metric-label\">RC1 strict pass@1</div><span class=\"metric-value\">100.00%</span><span class=\"metric-context\">beta16: 95.83%, +4.17 pp</span></article>\n        <article class=\"metric\"><div class=\"metric-label\">Both versions pass@3</div><span class=\"metric-value\">100%</span><span class=\"metric-context\">16/16 tasks succeed at least once</span></article>\n        <article class=\"metric\"><div class=\"metric-label\">RC1 pass^3</div><span class=\"metric-value\">100.00%</span><span class=\"metric-context\">beta16: 87.50%, +12.50 pp</span></article>\n        <article class=\"metric\"><div class=\"metric-label\">Mean model duration</div><span class=\"metric-value\">−22.3%</span><span class=\"metric-context\">391.3s vs 503.6s</span></article>\n      </div></section>\n      <section aria-labelledby=\"reliability\"><h2 id=\"reliability\">pass@k results</h2><article class=\"figure\"><div class=\"figure-head\"><h3 class=\"figure-title\">Figure 1. pass@1, pass@3, and pass^3</h3><span class=\"figure-note\">Percent, higher is better</span></div><div class=\"legend\"><span style=\"--legend-color: var(--native)\">RC1</span><span style=\"--legend-color: var(--classic)\">beta16</span></div><div class=\"chart\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"RC1 and beta16 reliability comparison\"><div class=\"chart-row\">\n              <div class=\"chart-label\">pass@1</div>\n              <div class=\"bar-pair\">\n                <div class=\"track\"><div class=\"bar\" style=\"--value: 100.00%; --color: var(--native)\"></div></div>\n                <div class=\"track\"><div class=\"bar\" style=\"--value: 95.83%; --color: var(--classic)\"></div></div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"chart-value\">100.0<br />95.8</div>\n            </div><div class=\"chart-row\">\n              <div class=\"chart-label\">pass@3</div>\n              <div class=\"bar-pair\">\n                <div class=\"track\"><div class=\"bar\" style=\"--value: 100.00%; --color: var(--native)\"></div></div>\n                <div class=\"track\"><div class=\"bar\" style=\"--value: 100.00%; --color: var(--classic)\"></div></div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"chart-value\">100<br />100</div>\n            </div><div class=\"chart-row\">\n              <div class=\"chart-label\">pass^3</div>\n              <div class=\"bar-pair\">\n                <div class=\"track\"><div class=\"bar\" style=\"--value: 100.00%; --color: var(--native)\"></div></div>\n                <div class=\"track\"><div class=\"bar\" style=\"--value: 87.50%; --color: var(--classic)\"></div></div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"chart-value\">100.0<br />87.5</div>\n            </div></div><p class=\"caption\"><code>pass@3</code> requires at least one success in three attempts; <code>pass^3</code> requires all three. Read together, they show both coverage and repeated-run reliability.</p></article></section>\n      <section aria-labelledby=\"efficiency\"><h2 id=\"efficiency\">Completed-task execution efficiency</h2><p>Only the 46 matching task repetitions that both versions strictly passed are included, preventing early failures from looking artificially cheap.</p><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>Metric</th><th class=\"number\">RC1</th><th class=\"number\">beta16</th><th class=\"number\">RC1 difference</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Model starts/resumes</td><td class=\"number\">1.15</td><td class=\"number\">1.89</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">−39.1%</span></td></tr><tr><td>Agent turns</td><td class=\"number\">83.39</td><td class=\"number\">77.54</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score partial\">+7.5%</span></td></tr><tr><td>Tool calls</td><td class=\"number\">97.35</td><td class=\"number\">74.65</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score partial\">+30.4%</span></td></tr><tr><td>Cumulative model duration</td><td class=\"number\">396.3s</td><td class=\"number\">501.6s</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">−21.0%</span></td></tr><tr><td>Non-cache input tokens</td><td class=\"number\">75,102</td><td class=\"number\">73,632</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score partial\">+2.0%</span></td></tr><tr><td>Output tokens</td><td class=\"number\">35,445</td><td class=\"number\">46,604</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">−23.9%</span></td></tr><tr><td>Total tokens including cache</td><td class=\"number\">4,474,779</td><td class=\"number\">3,730,902</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score partial\">+19.9%</span></td></tr><tr><td>Model cost</td><td class=\"number\">$4.003</td><td class=\"number\">$3.348</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score partial\">+19.6%</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"caption\">Both sides preserve peak-context telemetry for 48/48 runs. Mean peak context is 102,470 tokens for RC1 and 104,208 for beta16. RC1 is shorter in duration but uses more turns, tools, total tokens, and average cost in the paired success view.</p></section>\n      <section aria-labelledby=\"latency\"><h2 id=\"latency\">Corrected model duration</h2><article class=\"figure\"><div class=\"figure-head\"><h3 class=\"figure-title\">Figure 2. Cumulative raw result duration per sample</h3><span class=\"figure-note\">Seconds, lower is better</span></div><div class=\"legend\"><span style=\"--legend-color: var(--native)\">RC1</span><span style=\"--legend-color: var(--classic)\">beta16</span></div><div class=\"chart\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"RC1 and beta16 duration comparison\"><div class=\"chart-row\">\n              <div class=\"chart-label\">Mean</div>\n              <div class=\"bar-pair\">\n                <div class=\"track\"><div class=\"bar\" style=\"--value: 77.70%; --color: var(--native)\"></div></div>\n                <div class=\"track\"><div class=\"bar\" style=\"--value: 100.00%; --color: var(--classic)\"></div></div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"chart-value\">391.3<br />503.6</div>\n            </div><div class=\"chart-row\">\n              <div class=\"chart-label\">Median</div>\n              <div class=\"bar-pair\">\n                <div class=\"track\"><div class=\"bar\" style=\"--value: 77.45%; --color: var(--native)\"></div></div>\n                <div class=\"track\"><div class=\"bar\" style=\"--value: 100.00%; --color: var(--classic)\"></div></div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"chart-value\">369.1<br />476.5</div>\n            </div></div><p class=\"caption\">Duration sums every top-level <code>result.duration_ms</code> and excludes Docker setup and task-validator time. RC1: 48 observable samples; beta16: 48.</p></article></section>\n      <section aria-labelledby=\"matrix\"><h2 id=\"matrix\">Task-level stability matrix</h2><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>Task</th><th class=\"number\">RC1</th><th class=\"number\">beta16</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>agent-memory-routing</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td></tr><tr><td>api-cache-ttl</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td></tr><tr><td>cross-file-refactor</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score partial\">2/3</span></td></tr><tr><td>dependency-confusion</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td></tr><tr><td>fix-median</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td></tr><tr><td>framework-selection</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td></tr><tr><td>full-workflow</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td></tr><tr><td>graph-execution-review</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td></tr><tr><td>human-approval-flow</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td></tr><tr><td>layered-streaming-fix</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td></tr><tr><td>noise-distractor</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score partial\">2/3</span></td></tr><tr><td>observability-env-template</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td></tr><tr><td>perf-dedupe</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td></tr><tr><td>persistence-threading</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td></tr><tr><td>refactor-counter</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td></tr><tr><td>robust-config</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"caption\">RC1 has 16/16 tasks with three strict passes; beta16 has 14/16. Both cover all 16 tasks at least once.</p></section>\n      <section aria-labelledby=\"failures\"><h2 id=\"failures\">Failure attribution</h2><div class=\"method-grid\"><article class=\"method-item\"><h3>RC1: parser false positive corrected</h3><p>The raw snapshot's Skill <code>*</code> came from a shell glob in a <code>find</code> command. The fixed parser sees only the explicit <code>comet-native</code> invocation.</p></article><article class=\"method-item\"><h3>beta16: 1 workflow-only failure</h3><p><code>cross-file-refactor</code> r3 lacked the expected artifact, terminal state, and complete trajectory; its business validator passed.</p></article><article class=\"method-item\"><h3>beta16: 1 business plus workflow failure</h3><p><code>noise-distractor</code> r2 failed the invoice tax calculation and also lacked artifact/state/trajectory evidence.</p></article><article class=\"method-item\"><h3>Judge not used as a substitute</h3><p>The report uses deterministic validators, final pass state, and raw result duration rather than qualitative Judge prose.</p></article></div></section>\n      <section aria-labelledby=\"boundary\"><h2 id=\"boundary\">Comparison boundaries</h2><div class=\"method-grid\"><article class=\"method-item\"><h3>Aligned</h3><p>Same 16 business tasks, validators, model selection, interaction mode, and three repetitions.</p></article><article class=\"method-item\"><h3>Version-specific</h3><p>RC1 and beta16 workflow checks follow their own Native artifact, state, loop, and trajectory contracts.</p></article><article class=\"method-item\"><h3>Analysis set</h3><p>48 unique reports per version, all included with high confidence; four exit-125 recovery shells are excluded as harness noise.</p></article><article class=\"method-item\"><h3>Time-window limit</h3><p>beta16 is a reused historical run, so duration is directional evidence rather than a controlled causal estimate.</p></article></div><div class=\"callout\"><strong>Conclusion</strong><p>On this aligned task set, RC1 keeps full task-level pass@3 coverage, improves strict reliability modestly, and reduces raw model duration. The paired efficiency view also shows higher turns, tools, total tokens, and cost, so the result is a trade-off rather than a universal efficiency win.</p></div></section></main><script>\n      const links = document.querySelectorAll(\".language-toggle a[data-locale]\");\n      const mains = document.querySelectorAll(\"main.localized\");\n      const setLocale = (locale) => {\n        mains.forEach((main) => { main.hidden = main.dataset.locale !== locale; });\n        links.forEach((link) => { link.classList.toggle(\"is-active\", link.dataset.locale === locale); });\n      };\n      links.forEach((link) => link.addEventListener(\"click\", (event) => {\n        if (document.querySelectorAll(\"main.localized\").length > 0) {\n          event.preventDefault();\n          setLocale(link.dataset.locale);\n        }\n      }));\n    </script></body>\n</html>\n"
}
